<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine July inflation steady at 4.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippine July inflation steady at 4.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine annualised consumer</p>
<p>inflation remained at 4.8 percent in July, unchanged from the</p>
<p>June level, the National Statistics Office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    CONSUMER PRICES	    July 97  June 97  July 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	+0.1     +1.3    +0.1</p>
<p>    Yr-on-yr change		+4.8     +4.8    +8.9</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1988)     239.3    239.0   228.4</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (63 2) 810-9638 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
